<item><title>Expression of Interest (EOI) Tiaro Bypass-Bruce Highway (Gympie-Maryborough)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Contract no. CN-24518 (371601 – 228/10B)<br /><br />Contractors pre-qualified at level R4/ B3/ F150 plus or higher are invited to submit expressions of interest for construction of the Bruce Highway (Gympie – Maryborough), Tiaro Bypass.<br /><br />Prequalified contractors are to email BUND_PPS@tmr.qld.gov.au to be registered for access to the expression of interest documents which will be available on the Energy and Public Works QBuild eTender website https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au/<br /><br />Submissions are to be electronic via the Energy and Public Works QBuild eTender website https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au/<br /><br />Where a prequalification level is stated, the Principal is not obliged to provide documents, consider or accept an expression of interest unless the company is appropriately registered under the Department of Transport and Main Roads Prequalification System for the levels outlined in the expression of interest.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519940<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
