<item><title>Site Plumbing Services - Brigalow Peaking Power Plant Project BOP Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> EXPRESSION OF INTEREST FOR SITE PLUMBING SERVICES<br /><br />Monadelphous is currently undertaking the construction of the greenfield Brigalow Peaking Power Plant (PPP), a gas-fired power station being delivered for CS Energy.<br /><br />As part of this project, we require Site Plumbing Services to assist the temporary construction facilities. <br /><br />Please reply to this expression of interest with your capability and desire to go onto a tender list to quote the beforementioned works. (scope summary provided below).<br /><br />The Scope of Works will include the supply and installation of plumbing services to connect temporary construction facilities. The facilities will include 2x temporary offices with kitchenettes, 12x Lunch Rooms, 4x Ablution blocks, 1x Medical/Frist Aid room, grey and potable water tanks. The service provider will be required to install connecting plumbing between facilities and tanks.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Monadelphous<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519890<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Gas Energy, Infrastructure, Equipment, Utilities, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
