<item><title>Disaster Recovery - Human and Social Services Standing Offer Arrangement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Disaster Recovery: Human and Social Services SOA is being refreshed to ensure the continued delivery of high-quality, consistent, and efficient support services to individuals and communities affected by disasters across Queensland. This arrangement will streamline the procurement process for Queensland Government agencies and ensure access to pre-qualified suppliers for critical support services during disaster recovery efforts.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Families, Seniors, Disability Serv & Child Safety<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519878<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
