<item><title>Verge and Horse Trail Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council invites Tenderers to perform the Services as specified in these Tender Documents for annual verge and horse trail maintenance for the 2026/2027 and 2027/2028 spring/summer seasons at the locations set out in the Attachments. <br /><br />Maintenance will include at least one cut of grass per spring/summer season (i.e. at least two cuts in total) within the specified areas. Depending on growing conditions an additional cut or cuts may be required, as directed by Council in its sole discretion.<br /><br />Tenderers must note the requirements as to areas to be mown set out in the ‘Final Comments’ column in Attachment No. 1.<br /><br />In addition to the annual minimum maintenance work, Council may require additional work to be done. Tenderers must provide details of the rates at which they are prepared to do such additional work.<br /><br />CLOSE OF TENDER<br /><br />12pm, Wednesday 19 August 2026<br /><br />LATE TENDERS WILL NOT BE ACCEPTED<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Clarence<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Hobart time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519774<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Rebecca-Ann Riseley Email: rriseley@ccc.tas.gov.au Tel: 6217 9767<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
