<item><title>Kerb and Gutter Network Condition Assessment, Asset Verification and 10-Year Renewal Forecast</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Balranald Shire Council invites suitably qualified and experienced consultants to submit a quotation for the provision of a comprehensive Kerb and Gutter Network Condition Assessment, Asset Verification and 10-Year Renewal Forecast across Council's kerb and gutter network.<br /><br />The successful consultant will undertake a network-wide condition assessment, verify existing asset inventory data, validate and update GIS asset information and develop a 10-year renewal and financial forecast to support Council's asset management, long-term financial planning and capital works programming. <br /><br />Council maintains a GIS-based asset register and can provide all relevant GIS layers and associated asset information, including asset lengths, asset types, construction dates and other asset attributes.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Balranald Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519736<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Quenten Graham Email: qgraham@balranald.nsw.gov.au Tel: 03 5020 1300<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
