<item><title>2627-03 Warner Reserve - Southern Soccer Field Lighting Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Construction of a new sports oval lighting system on the southern soccer field at Warner Reserve, in Springvale. The lighting will be 100lux LED technology including poles, cabling, and electrical infrastructure. The sports lighting system will be built in accordance with Australian Standards and provide club members and the community with a modern, compliant, safe and efficient playing venue.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519471<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
