<item><title>Expression of Interest (EOI) Road Safety Systems Program (RSSP) ICT Managed Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Customer requires a Supplier to provide managed services including the provision of ongoing operational support and maintenance (ITIL) and ongoing software development services for future enhancements to the three workstreams under its Road Safety Systems Program (RSSP):<br /><br />1. Camera and Image Data Management System (CIDMS);<br /><br />2. Planning and Scheduling Services (PSS); and<br /><br />3. Data, Analytics and Reporting Platform (DARP).<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads - ITB<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Aug/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519257<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Alicia Anderson Email: alicia.m.anderson@tmr.qld.gov.au Tel: 0730666905<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
