<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Health is developing a competitive Invitation to Offer to establish a Standing Offer Arrangement (SOA) for wound care consumables, consolidating two legacy arrangements (SOA274 and SOA286) across Queensland's 16 Hospital and Health Services.<br /><br />This is an industry announcement only, not an Invitation to Offer, and no response is sought at this stage. The attached announcement and indicative volumes outline the scope, procurement objectives, indicative timing, and how suppliers can prepare ahead of the formal ITO.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Health<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP516477<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
