<item><title>Belmont State School – New A Block</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Education (DoE) is calling for submissions for the Design and Construction of the new A Block Building and associated works located at Belmont State School at 1275 Old Cleveland Road, Carindale, 4152. The new A Block Building consists of 4 No. General Learning Classrooms over 2 levels, inclusive of Staff Area, Collaboration Spaces, Data Room, Amenities and Storerooms. The project also includes a new high-level walkway to connect the existing J Block to the new A Block, new covered access link and pathways, Landscaping, and the demolition of the existing M3 Block and A Block.<br /><br />Tender documentation is available electronically from RPS Australia Asia Pacific. Please email your request with your PQC Certificate and company registration details to chris.ray@rpsconsulting.com<br /><br />Submissions close on 08 September 2026 at 2:00pm delivered electronically to RPS.rpa.QEDTenders@rpsconsulting.com only.<br /><br />Site Visit Details: 10 August 2026 at 10:00am at 1275 Old Cleveland Road,...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Education<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519531<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
