<item><title>ROPS Trade Maintenance and Associated Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Banana Shire Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for appointment to a panel of pre-qualified suppliers to provide trade maintenance and associated services throughout the Shire, as detailed in Part 5 – Scope. Successful tenderers will be awarded pre-qualified supplier status for an initial term ending 30 June 2028, with Council reserving the option to extend the arrangement for a further twelve (12) months at its discretion. The panel will be used to engage suppliers for the delivery of maintenance, repair, and related trade services across Council facilities and infrastructure within the Banana Shire local government area.<br /><br />The Register of Pre-Qualified Suppliers (ROPS) will be reviewed and updated annually at the commencement of each financial year. New contractors and suppliers are encouraged to apply for inclusion on the panel by submitting the required tender documentation during the annual review process. Existing pre-qualified suppliers may also submit ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Banana Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519446<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., IT & Telecomms, Security Services & Equipment, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
