<item><title>CMS Support and Maintenance Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Bayswater (“the Principal”) is a WA local government located approximately eight kilometres north-east of the Perth CBD. It includes the suburbs of Bayswater, Bedford, Embleton, Morley, Noranda, Maylands and parts of Mount Lawley and Dianella.<br /><br />The Principal is seeking responses from suitably qualified and experienced CMS content support providers ("Respondents") to deliver ongoing content management support services for its corporate website, which operates on the Kentico Xperience cloud platform. <br /><br />The Principal intends to contract the successful Respondent (“Contractor”) for an initial term of 24 months, with three (3) term extension options each of 12 months for a maximum Contract Term of 60 months. A decision to exercise a term extension option will be at the sole discretion of the Principal and subject to the Principal’s operational requirements and the Contractor’s performance. <br /><br />The Statement of Requirement (Part 2 of this Request) sets out a full description ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Bayswater<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518228<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
