<item><title>Waste Removal Services - Brigalow Peaking Power Plant Project BOP Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> EXPRESSION OF INTEREST FOR WASTE REMOVAL SERVICES <br /><br />Monadelphous is currently undertaking the construction of the greenfield Brigalow Peaking Power Plant (PPP), a gas-fired power station being delivered for CS Energy.<br /><br />As part of this project, we require Site Waste Removal Services.<br /><br />Please reply to this expression of interest with your capability and desire to go onto a tender list to quote the beforementioned works. (scope summary provided below).<br /><br />This Services Scope is to provide collection, transport, tracking, and lawful disposal/recycling of construction waste and regulated (trackable) waste generated in accordance with the Environmental Protection Act 1994, Environmental Protection Regulation 2019, and all applicable Queensland regulated waste tracking requirements.<br /><br />The scope will include possible waste streams but is not limited to the below:<br /><br />•	Hydrocarbon-contaminated soil.<br /><br />•	Waste oils and lubricants.<br /><br />•	Oily water a...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Monadelphous<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519304<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
