<item><title>DRFA Landslips Package 1 (Site ID: 3, 4 and 6)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> INVITATION FOR TENDERS – YASC 2026-020<br /><br />Yarrabah Aboriginal Shire Council (the Principal) invites tenders for Landslip Package 1, comprising landslip remediation and associated road reinstatement works at Sites 3, 4 and 6 in Yarrabah.<br /><br />The works generally include bulk excavation, slope stabilisation, installation of soil nails and percussion anchors, horizontal drains, surface treatments including shotcrete and erosion protection, localised rock and boulder management, drainage improvements, and reinstatement of affected road pavement and shoulders.<br /><br />All works are to be completed in accordance with the issued design documentation, with due consideration to site access, vegetation, constructability constraints, and site-specific geotechnical conditions.<br /><br />Tender documentation may be obtained VendorPanel on Friday 31st of July 2026.<br /><br />A mandatory tender briefing will be held onsite 11:00AM Monday 10th of August 2026. Respondents must RSVP to mgeoghegan@yarrabah.ql...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Yarrabah Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519320<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
