<item><title>Vegetation Management Services Panel Contract</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Lismore City Council is seeking to establish a Panel of Suppliers to provide vegetation management services across Council-owned and managed land, infrastructure corridors, reserves, parks, roadsides, waterways, and other public assets.<br /><br />The purpose of the unranked panel is to provide Council with access to suitably qualified, experienced, and resourced contractors capable of delivering safe, efficient, environmentally responsible, and compliant vegetation management services on an as-required basis. The panel arrangement will enable Council to engage suppliers for planned, reactive, emergency, and project-based works at fixed rates for the stated period.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Lismore City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517756<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Megan Daley Email: megan.daley@lismore.nsw.gov.au Tel: 02 66250514<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
