<item><title>Bairnsdale Landfill Fire Protection System (Design and Construct)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this PPR - East Gippsland Shire Council requires a complete, code-compliant fire protection water supply system for the operational Bairnsdale Landfill (CON2027 1768), 200 Johnstons Road, Forge Creek). The Contractor designs and constructs the system: fire water storage, electric and diesel fire pumps, a fire brigade booster, an underground ring main and branch mains, hydrants FH1 to FH9, hose reels FHR2 to FHR7, valves, monitoring and the independent test drainage facility. The completed asset must deliver the required fire-fighting flow and pressure across the site, suit its intended purpose, and remain maintainable over its design life on a live landfill. <br /><br />This PPR is a contract exhibit. The Contractor warrants that its design and the completed works will satisfy this PPR. The contract form is AS 4902-2000 (Design and Construct) per the recorded contract-form decision. The order of precedence is set in the contract Annexure and Special Conditions. Acceptance of any design submissi...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> East Gippsland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518995<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Fire & Safety<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 15]]></description>
