<item><title>IRC-IS-0526-T478 Floodway Renewal and Upgrade 2026-27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Isaac Regional Council (Council) is seeking a suitably qualified contractor for the construction of four (4) new floodways and upgrade/renewal of three (3) existing floodways to improve flood resilience within the Isaac region. Floodway works include construction of side tracks (as required), drainage structures, approach pavements, and associated furniture.<br /><br />Optional site meeting 11 August 2026, see Request for Tender for further information.<br /><br />Tender closes 2pm 20 August 2026.<br /><br />Kind regards Isaac Regional Council<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Isaac Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518797<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
