<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Redland City Council (RCC) requires a head Contractor to complete identified Drainage, Kerb, Concrete and Associated Works prior to road resurfacing works commencing. These civil works consist of the removal/ supply/ installation/ construction of identified civil infrastructure including; non-compliant/ damaged drainage structures, grates, sections of poor condition kerb and channel, subsoil drains, other identified works and associated works, at various locations within Redland City<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Redland City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518729<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 19]]></description>
