<item><title>Expression of Interest - CPA/000712 Adaptive Reuse - Former Gosford Library</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central Coast Council is seeking Expression of Interests (EOI) from experienced heritage architects to develop plans for the adaptive reuse of the Former Gosford Library, located at 118-120 Donnison Street, Gosford for community and commercial purposes.<br /><br />A Site Inspection of the Former Gosford Library will be available:<br /><br />Date: Thursday, 13 August 2026<br /><br />Time: 2:00pm – 4:00pm<br /><br />Location: 118-120 Donnison Street, Gosford<br /><br />Please provide you intention to attend the Site Inspection to Kellie Neville at Kellie.Neville@centralcoast.nsw.gov.au prior to the date of the inspection.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518739<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Kellie Neville Email: kellie.neville@centralcoast.nsw.gov.au Tel: 43047098<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
