<item><title>Head Contractor - Kuranda District State College - Multi-Purpose Sports Facility Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Education (DoE) is calling for submissions for:<br /><br />•	Construction of a Multi-Purpose Sports Facility Upgrade inclusive of:<br /><br />•	Demolishing existing court 1 completely <br /><br />•	Providing a new court 1 with all-weather enclosure<br /><br />•	New communications room<br /><br />•	Refurbishing the existing amenities (as required to meet NCC, AS1428 for building approval, and Queensland Education Design Guidelines) <br /><br />Removal<br /><br />•	Cricket nets<br /><br />•	Outdoor gym (relocation)<br /><br />Relocation<br /><br />•	Flagpole and ANZAC memorial rock with plaque<br /><br />•	The currently undetermined water infrastructure near the storage area<br /><br />Located at 260 Myola Road, Kuranda, 4881.<br /><br />Tender submissions will be accepted from eligible contractors that satisfy the PQC requirements of this project.<br /><br />Please contact Vanessa Walker (Project Manager) on telephone 0417 917 799 or email vanessa.w@thomsonruiz.com for further information.<br...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Education<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518706<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
