<item><title>CCTV Phase 2 Renewal Project_Network Hardware</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Greater Dandenong is undertaking the CCTV Phase 2 Renewal Project to improve the reliability, performance and resilience of Council's CCTV network infrastructure. As part of this project, Council is seeking the supply and delivery of network hardware, including network switches and associated equipment, to support continued operation and monitoring of the CCTV network.<br /><br />The proposed hardware will enable proactive monitoring of network performance and system uptime across the CCTV environment. This investment is intended to improve network reliability, enhance system availability, and support faster identification and response to network or system disruptions.<br /><br />Council invites submissions from suitably qualified suppliers with demonstrated experience in supplying enterprise-grade network hardware and associated support services. Suppliers are expected to provide equipment that meets the technical specifications outlined in the tender documentation and can be delivered within the...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518704<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Rohit Verma Email: rohit.verma@cgd.vic.gov.au Tel: +61385715283<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Electronic Components & Supplies, IT & Telecomms, Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
