<item><title>ITT2528 Design and Construct Synthetic Soccer Field – Honey Farm Road Sports Precinct</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council is seeking an experienced contractor to deliver the design and construction of a synthetic soccer field and associated works.<br /><br />The site is located within Council’s Honey Farm Road Sports Precinct, 4 Honey Farm Road, Meridan Plains.<br /><br />The scope of work will include, but not be limited to:<br /><br />•Detailed design of a FIFA certified synthetic soccer field;<br /><br />•Construction of a synthetic soccer field;<br /><br />•Associated drainage, irrigation and surrounding civil works;<br /><br />•Spectator fencing and behind goal ball stop;<br /><br />•All relevant approvals and full RPEQ certification of works and<br /><br />•Warranty and Maintenance period.<br /><br />Due to the required interface with adjacent site construction activity, a two phase construction delivery will be required.<br /><br />Phase One - civil works associated with the contract to prepare for the synthetic surface. It is anticipated these works will commence upon final design approval.<br /><b...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518137<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 23]]></description>
