<item><title>T27007 – Community Safety Camera Network – Service and Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Contract No. T27007 - Community Camera Safety Network – Service and Maintenance <br /><br />The Council is seeking the services of a suitably qualified Security contractor to provide service, maintenance and associated works to Councils owned Community Camera Safety Network (CCSN) that is located across key precincts throughout the City of Stonnington.<br /><br />Tenderers must hold the required qualifications and demonstrate experience in the provision of the requested services, preferably in a local government environment.<br /><br />Council will only accept Offers from an incorporated entity, a trustee or a partnership for engagements that are ongoing standing offers, performance based or not directly related to a single project.<br /><br />NOTE: The Vendor Panel online forum closes five business days prior to the abovementioned tender closing date. Council reserves the right not to accept the lowest or any Tender, or part thereof. Tenders received after the closing time will not be considered.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518317<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
