<item><title>00013002 AI Match Tender Alerts</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Request for Information (RFI) is a market intelligence and requirements-refinement exercise, used to inform QUT’s understanding of available solutions and delivery approaches in this domain. <br /><br />Specifically, this RFI is intended to:<br /><br />•	Gain insight into current market capabilities, solution architectures and emerging delivery approaches for automated tender-to-capability matching<br /><br />•	Inform the development of scope, requirements and evaluation approach for any potential future procurement activity<br /><br />•	Understand indicative pricing models and commercial approaches, sizing, implementation considerations and delivery models<br /><br />•	Understand how suppliers are addressing key constraints including data sovereignty, privacy, customer data handling, identity integration, and auditability<br /><br />All queries relating to this tender must be received by the above email by close of business (AEST) on 5/08/2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland University of Technology<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Aug/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518042<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=88618004f933402099cea2877c1b34e5s518042se5e0fee99bee4eef813ebcd8f1872d76s1578</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">88618004f933402099cea2877c1b34e5</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 06:17:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>IT &amp; Telecomms</category>
</item>
<item><title>MWD - CN-27303 - MRC LGA Weed Treatment Works FY26/27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This request for quote is for the management of restricted invasive and locally declared plants along state-controlled roads within the Mackay Regional Council (MRC) Local Government Area (LGA) during the 2026/2027 Financial Year. <br /><br />The scope of works includes the control of 'restricted invasive' and 'locally declared' plants within the Mackay Regional Council Local Government Areas, which are defined and managed as per the Department of Transport and Main Roads’ Maintenance Preservation and Operation (MPO) Element 5 Invasive Plants and Animals framework.<br /><br />In this instance:<br /><br />• “restricted invasive” refers to restricted invasive plants listed under the Biosecurity Act 2014.<br /><br />• "locally declared" refers to locally declared plants listed under the current version of the local council Biosecurity Plan<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-Central Qld<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518023<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Chemicals, Biochemical, Gas, Environmental & Heritage Services, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
