<item><title>Supply and Delivery of a New Truck with Tipper Body and Crane</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Balranald Shire Council invites quotations from suitably qualified suppliers for the supply and delivery of one (1) new truck fitted with a tipper body and hydraulic crane to replace and supplement Council's existing fleet.<br /><br />The replacement vehicle is required to provide a reliable, heavy-duty platform suitable for road maintenance, construction, parks and gardens, drainage, asset maintenance, and general municipal operations.<br /><br />Council seeks a vehicle equivalent or superior to an Isuzu FRR 110-240 AMT fitted with a steel tipper body and a truck-mounted hydraulic crane with a minimum five tonne lifting capacity.<br /><br />Council also requests suppliers provide optional trade-in valuations for:<br /><br />•	2 × Isuzu NPR400<br /><br />•	1 × Isuzu NQR450<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Balranald Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Aug/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517940<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Quenten Graham Email: qgraham@balranald.nsw.gov.au Tel: 03 5020 1300<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
