<item><title>Risk-Response Bail Program</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The State of Queensland, through the Department of Youth Justice and Victim Support, is inviting quotes for the delivery of the Risk-Response Bail Program (R-RBP).<br /><br />The R-RBP is a statewide, community-based initiative designed to support young people, generally aged 10–17, who are on bail and at risk of breaching their bail conditions or posing a risk to the community. <br /><br />The primary objective of the R-RBP is to reduce youth offending while on bail by addressing risk factors that may lead to new offences or breaches of bail conditions during the period of program support.<br /><br />The program must be accessible to any young person in Queensland who has been granted court-ordered bail. It will be delivered across thirteen locations covering Geographic Catchment Area - Brisbane, Moreton Bay, Cairns, Townsville, Mount Isa, Gold Coast, Logan, Cherbourg, Ipswich, Toowoomba, Rockhampton, Hervey Bay, and Sunshine Coast.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Youth Justice and Victim Support<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517024<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=507ddfedca7b4694a6b504fa39694649s517024s3042a24f284440dda01247ddebc36fa8s1553</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">507ddfedca7b4694a6b504fa39694649</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Community &amp; Social Services</category>
</item>
<item><title>EOI 18.26 Pavement Strengthening, Apron Expansion and Airfield Ground Lighting – Onslow</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Ashburton (the Principal) is seeking Expressions of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified and experienced construction contractors for the delivery of the Onslow Airport Runway Pavement Strengthening and Aircraft Capacity Expansion Project (the Project).<br /><br />The Project forms a critical infrastructure upgrade to support the continued safe operation of Onslow Airport and accommodate larger Code C aircraft, ensuring long-term serviceability and regional connectivity.<br /><br />This EOI is a pre-qualification and shortlisting process intended to identify contractors with the demonstrated capability, capacity, and relevant experience to be invited to participate in a subsequent Request for Tender (RFT) for the construction works.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Ashburton<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517497<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
