<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>2027/332 Footpath Program - Mildura - Jaycee Park</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mildura Rural City Council is seeking Tender responses from suitably qualified individuals and organisations to undertake civil construction works associated with the Jaycee Park Missing Link Footpath project. <br /><br />This will include site preparation, removal of existing assets, construction of approximately 478 m² of reinforced concrete footpath and associated crossover works, installation of new bollards and chain barrier, landscaping and reinstatement works, and post-project site clean-up in accordance with the Contract Specifications and Drawings.<br /><br />ENQUIRIES: Any tender enquiries should be directed to the online forum in VendorPanel.<br /><br />INSPECTION: A site inspection with Council is available on request via the forum. Inspections are recommended however not mandatory.<br /><br />SUBMISSIONS: Completed responses can ONLY be submitted electronically by uploading into the VendorPanel System. Respondents will receive a confirmation email response upon completion. Should assistance be re...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mildura Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517468<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
