<item><title>T2026-09 Bathurst Street Bridge Replacement, Sawyers Gully</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Cessnock City Council is undertaking the replacement of existing timber bridge at Bathurst Street, Sawyers Gully, NSW, under a construction-only contract. The project forms part of Council's commitment to renewing ageing infrastructure, improving structural capacity, enhancing road safety, and maintaining reliable connectivity for local community.<br /><br />The Contractor will be responsible for the delivery of the following activities:<br /><br />- Pre Construction Activities <br /><br />- Bridge Demolition <br /><br />- Bridge Construction<br /><br />- Roadworks and Pavement Stabilisation Work <br /><br />- Finalisation and Close-Out and<br /><br />- as per the Tender Documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cessnock City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP516609<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
