<item><title>EOI - Port of Mackay - New Lease for Vessel Maintenance Facility</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> North Queensland Bulk Ports Corporation (NQBP) is seeking Expressions of Interest from suitably qualified owner-operators for the long-term lease of the Mackay vessel<br /><br />maintenance facility. The facility is intended to support regional vessel maintenance, shipbuilding, and marine services, addressing significant market demand for vessel servicing across the Central Queensland coast.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> North Queensland Bulk Ports Corporation<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP511777<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Fleet Servicing & Accessories, Marine Transp. Products & Services, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
