<item><title>Expression of Interest Supply of Fill for Coolum Site</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> EDQ is seeking expressions of interest to supply and deliver suitable fill material to the site for stockpile. Individual offers to supply should be of quantities generally in excess of 1,000 cubic metres.<br /><br />This Expression of Interest will remain open for a period of 12 months, during which time suppliers can respond by submitting a Quote to Supply document.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Economic Development Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Jun/2027 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP455349<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
